  "goodToKnow": "Das Himmelreich is the kingdom of heaven in Christian language: ins Himmelreich kommen, das Himmelreich auf Erden (heaven on earth). It appears in Luther's Bible and many hymns. Das Reich means realm or empire: das Heilige Römische Reich, das Deutsche Reich (1871–1945), which is why the word sounds loaded in politics. Der Himmel means both sky and heaven. It has no plural."
